    "/** True on the live-preview block, where the reader is still typing the line. */",
    "/**\n * Render every query block under `root`. Returns immediately for a block whose bodies are still on\n * their way; those are finished by the pump that subscribes to the index.\n */",
    "// Kept on the host rather than only in this call's closure: the pump re-answers a block when the",
    "// index moves, long after the surface that mounted it has re-rendered.",
