    "/* A card is one container. Its rows are placed by the layout, which is why the row pitch, the handle and\n   the chip advances are written here as well as in `json-map-view.ts`: the layout measures the row as\n   this stylesheet will paint it, so a change to either alone shows up as clipped or drifting text.\n   The kind stripe is an inset shadow rather than a thick border for exactly that reason: a 3px border\n   would take 3px away from every row, and the widest row of every card would ellipsize. */",
